    <style>
        :root {
            --shuiro: #a52a2a;      /* 朱色 */
            --kin: #b09a5b;        /* 金色 */
            --washiiro: #f9f7f0;    /* 和紙色 */
            --sumiiro: #1c1c1c;     /* 墨色 */
            --gold-grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #b09a5b 0%, #f7ef8a 50%, #b09a5b 100%);
            --glass: rgba(249, 247, 240, 0.9);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
            background-color: var(--washiiro);
            color: var(--sumiiro);
            line-height: 1.8;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* --- Loading Animation --- */
        #loader {
            position: fixed; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: var(--sumiiro);
            z-index: 9999; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
            transition: 1s ease;
        }
        .loader-logo { color: var(--kin); font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 1rem; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
        @keyframes pulse { 0% { opacity: 0.5; } 50% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 0.5; } }

        /* --- Navigation --- */
        nav {
            position: fixed; top: 0; width: 100%; padding: 25px 50px;
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000; transition: 0.5s;
        }
        nav.scrolled {
            background: var(--glass); padding: 15px 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--kin);
        }
        .logo { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--shuiro); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.3rem; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; list-style: none; }
        .nav-links li { margin-left: 25px; }
        .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--sumiiro); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        nav:not(.scrolled) .nav-links a { color: #fff; text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--shuiro); }

        /* --- Hero Section --- */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #000;
        }
        .hero-bg {
            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 120%;
            background-size: cover; background-position: center; z-index: 1;
        }
        .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; text-align: center; color: #fff; }
        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem); letter-spacing: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: var(--gold-grad); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            filter: drop-shadow(2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));
        }
        .hero-content p { font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: 0.5rem; }

        /* --- Common Section Styling --- */
        section { padding: 120px 10%; position: relative; }
        .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 80px; }
        .section-header span { color: var(--kin); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .section-header h2 { font-size: 2.8rem; color: var(--shuiro); position: relative; }

        /* --- History Timeline --- */
        .history-container { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 50px; }
        .history-text { flex: 1.5; }
        .history-timeline { flex: 1; border-left: 2px solid var(--kin); padding-left: 30px; }
        .timeline-item { position: relative; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .timeline-item::before {
            content: ""; position: absolute; left: -41px; top: 5px;
            width: 20px; height: 20px; background: var(--shuiro); border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--kin);
        }
        .timeline-year { font-weight: 900; color: var(--shuiro); font-size: 1.3rem; display: block; }

        /* --- Cards & Grid --- */
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
        .card {
            background: #fff; padding: 40px; border: 1px solid rgba(176,154,91,0.2);
            transition: 0.5s; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-15px) rotateX(5deg);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(176,154,91,0.2);
            border-color: var(--kin);
        }
        .card h3 { color: var(--shuiro); margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kin); padding-bottom: 10px; }

        /* --- Event Table --- */
        .event-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #fff; }
        .event-table th, .event-table td { padding: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; text-align: left; }
        .event-table th { color: var(--shuiro); width: 25%; font-size: 1.1rem; }

        /* --- FAQ Accordion --- */
        .faq-item { background: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px; }
        .faq-question { padding: 20px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .faq-answer { padding: 0 20px 20px; display: none; color: #555; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 20px; }

        /* --- Access Info --- */
        .access-container { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px; background: #fff; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .access-info { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; }
        .access-map { flex: 1.5; min-width: 300px; height: 450px; border: 4px solid var(--kin); }

        /* --- Footer --- */

          /* --- Media Section --- */
  .media-grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px; }
  .media-card { flex: 1 1 400px; }
  .media-card img { width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }

footer { background: var(--sumiiro); color: var(--washiiro); padding: 100px 10% 50px; text-align: center; }
        .footer-logo { font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--kin); margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.5rem; }

        /* --- Reveal Animations --- */
        .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(50px); transition: 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.17, 0.67, 0.83, 0.67); }
        .reveal.active { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        /* --- お知らせ / 授与品 / 御朱印（GUI管理セクション） --- */
        .news-list { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .news-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(176,154,91,0.3); border-left: 5px solid var(--kin); padding: 25px 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .news-item.is-important { border-left-color: var(--shuiro); }
        .news-date { color: var(--kin); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.1rem; }
        .news-title { color: var(--shuiro); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 5px 0 10px; }
        .news-badge { display: inline-block; background: var(--shuiro); color: #fff; font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 3px; margin-left: 10px; vertical-align: middle; }
        .jyoyohin-img { height: 200px; background-size: cover; background-position: center; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: #f0ede2; }
        .jyoyohin-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 3px 12px; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--kin); color: #fff; }
        .price { font-weight: 900; color: var(--shuiro); font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .period { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #777; }
        .goshuin-box { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .goshuin-box dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr; gap: 10px 20px; }
        .goshuin-box dt { font-weight: 900; color: var(--shuiro); }
        .empty-note { text-align: center; color: #999; }

        /* --- 行事カレンダー --- */
        .cal-layout { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start; }
        .cal-panel { flex: 1.4 1 420px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(176,154,91,0.35); padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .cal-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .cal-title { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--shuiro); letter-spacing: 0.1rem; }
        .cal-nav { background: none; border: 1px solid var(--kin); color: var(--kin); font-family: inherit;
                   font-size: 1.1rem; width: 44px; height: 44px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; border-radius: 2px; }
        .cal-nav:hover { background: var(--kin); color: #fff; }
        .cal-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 4px; }
        .cal-dow { text-align: center; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 0; color: #666; }
        .cal-dow.sun { color: var(--shuiro); }
        .cal-dow.sat { color: #3a6ea5; }
        .cal-cell { min-height: 74px; border: 1px solid #f0ede2; padding: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; background: #fdfcf7; }
        .cal-cell.empty { background: transparent; border-color: transparent; }
        .cal-cell.today { border: 2px solid var(--kin); background: #fffdf2; }
        .cal-cell.has-event { cursor: pointer; }
        .cal-cell.has-event:hover { background: #f6f1e0; }
        .cal-cell.selected { background: #f3ead0; border-color: var(--kin); }
        .cal-num { font-weight: 700; color: #444; }
        .cal-cell.sun .cal-num { color: var(--shuiro); }
        .cal-cell.sat .cal-num { color: #3a6ea5; }
        .cal-tag { display: block; margin-top: 3px; font-size: 0.65rem; line-height: 1.35; color: #fff;
                   background: var(--shuiro); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
        .cal-tag.notice { background: var(--kin); }
        .cal-detail { margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 20px; min-height: 60px; }
        .cal-detail h4 { color: var(--shuiro); margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .cal-detail .meta { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #777; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .cal-detail .hint { color: #999; font-size: 0.9rem; }

        /* --- 次の行事 --- */
        .upcoming { flex: 1 1 300px; }
        .upcoming h3 { color: var(--shuiro); font-size: 1.3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kin); padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .up-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(176,154,91,0.3); padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start; }
        .up-date { flex: 0 0 62px; text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid #eee; padding-right: 12px; }
        .up-date .m { display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--kin); font-weight: 700; }
        .up-date .d { display: block; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--shuiro); line-height: 1.2; }
        .up-body .name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--sumiiro); }
        .up-body .sub { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #777; margin-top: 3px; }
        .up-cat { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.68rem; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--kin); color: #fff; margin-left: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }

        /* --- スマホ用メニュー（三本線ボタンと全画面メニュー） --- */
        .nav-toggle {
            display: none; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
            width: 48px; height: 48px; padding: 12px; z-index: 1200;
        }
        .nav-toggle span {
            display: block; height: 2px; width: 100%; background: #fff; margin: 5px 0;
            transition: 0.3s; border-radius: 1px; box-shadow: 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }
        nav.scrolled .nav-toggle span { background: var(--shuiro); box-shadow: none; }
        body.menu-open .nav-toggle span { background: var(--kin); box-shadow: none; }
        body.menu-open .nav-toggle span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg); }
        body.menu-open .nav-toggle span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
        body.menu-open .nav-toggle span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg); }

        .nav-overlay {
            position: fixed; inset: 0; background: var(--sumiiro); z-index: 1100;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-start; padding: 74px 0 28px;
            opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: 0.4s ease;
            overflow-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
        }
        body.menu-open .nav-overlay { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }
        body.menu-open { overflow: hidden; }
        /* メニューを開いている間は、閉じるボタンをメニューより前面に出す */
        body.menu-open #navbar { z-index: 1200; background: transparent; box-shadow: none; border-bottom: none; }
        body.menu-open .logo { color: var(--kin); }
        .nav-overlay ul { list-style: none; text-align: center; }
        .nav-overlay li { margin: 2px 0; }
        .nav-overlay a {
            display: block; color: var(--kin); text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.25rem; line-height: 1.4;
            padding: 9px 40px; transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .nav-overlay a:active, .nav-overlay a:hover { color: #fff; }

        /* 見出しへ移動したとき、固定メニューの下に隠れないようにする */
        section { scroll-margin-top: 80px; }

        /* 指で触る端末では、マウス前提の立体ホバーを無効にする */
        @media (hover: none) {
            .card:hover { transform: none; box-shadow: none; border-color: rgba(176,154,91,0.2); }
            .cal-cell.has-event:hover { background: #fdfcf7; }
        }

        /* ===== タブレット以下 ===== */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            section { padding: 90px 6%; }
            .section-header { margin-bottom: 50px; }
            .section-header h2 { font-size: 2.1rem; }
            .cal-layout { gap: 30px; }
        }

        /* ===== スマートフォン ===== */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav { padding: 10px 16px; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .nav-toggle { display: block; }
            .logo { font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: 0.2rem; }

            section { padding: 64px 5%; scroll-margin-top: 64px; }
            .section-header { margin-bottom: 40px; }
            .section-header h2 { font-size: 1.75rem; }
            .section-header span { font-size: 0.75rem; }

            .hero-content h1 { font-size: 2.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
            .hero-content p { font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 0.15rem; padding: 0 6%; }

            .card { padding: 24px; }
            .grid { gap: 20px; }

            /* 年中行事の表を縦積みにする */
            .event-table, .event-table tbody, .event-table tr, .event-table th, .event-table td {
                display: block; width: 100%;
            }
            .event-table tr { border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
            .event-table th { padding: 18px 18px 0; border-bottom: none; font-size: 1rem; }
            .event-table td { padding: 4px 18px 18px; border-bottom: none; }

            /* カレンダー */
            .cal-panel { padding: 14px; }
            .cal-grid { gap: 2px; }
            .cal-cell { min-height: 50px; padding: 3px; }
            .cal-num { font-size: 0.8rem; }
            /* 行事名は入りきらないため印（点）で示し、日を押すと下に詳細を出す */
            .cal-tag {
                display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; padding: 0;
                margin: 4px 2px 0 0; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 0; line-height: 0; overflow: hidden;
            }
            .cal-nav { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
            .cal-title { font-size: 1.2rem; }

            /* お知らせ・次の行事 */
            .news-item { padding: 18px 20px; }
            .up-item { padding: 14px 16px; }

            /* 御朱印・交通 */
            .goshuin-box { padding: 24px; }
            .goshuin-box dl { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
            .goshuin-box dt { margin-top: 12px; }
            .access-container { padding: 20px; gap: 24px; }
            .access-map { height: 280px; min-width: 0; border-width: 3px; }

            /* 由緒の年表 */
            .history-timeline { padding-left: 22px; }
            .timeline-item::before { left: -32px; width: 16px; height: 16px; }

            footer { padding: 60px 6% 40px; }
            .footer-logo { font-size: 1.8rem; }
        }

        /* ===== 小さめのスマートフォン ===== */
        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .hero-content h1 { font-size: 2.1rem; letter-spacing: 0.3rem; }
            .section-header h2 { font-size: 1.55rem; }
            .cal-panel { padding: 10px; }
            .cal-cell { min-height: 44px; }
            .cal-dow { font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 5px 0; }
            .card { padding: 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="loader"><div class="loader-logo">國坂神社</div></div>

    <nav id="navbar">
        <a href="#" class="logo">國坂神社</a>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#news">お知らせ</a></li>
            <li><a href="#history">由緒</a></li>
            <li><a href="#deity">祭神</a></li>
            <li><a href="#precincts">境内</a></li>
            <li><a href="#events">行事</a></li>
            <li><a href="#calendar">暦</a></li>
            <li><a href="#jyoyohin">授与品</a></li>
            <li><a href="#goshuin">御朱印</a></li>
            <li><a href="#access">交通</a></li>
            <li><a href="#media">作品</a></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- スマホ用：三本線ボタン -->
        <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" type="button" aria-label="メニューを開く" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navOverlay">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </button>
    </nav>

    <!-- スマホ用：全画面メニュー -->
    <div class="nav-overlay" id="navOverlay">
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#news">お知らせ</a></li>
            <li><a href="#history">由緒</a></li>
            <li><a href="#deity">祭神</a></li>
            <li><a href="#precincts">境内</a></li>
            <li><a href="#events">年中行事</a></li>
            <li><a href="#calendar">行事カレンダー</a></li>
            <li><a href="#jyoyohin">授与品</a></li>
            <li><a href="#goshuin">御朱印</a></li>
            <li><a href="#media">作品</a></li>
            <li><a href="#access">交通案内</a></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-bg" id="heroBg" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url('{{ settings.hero.image | asset }}');"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
            <p>{{ settings.hero.tagline_top }}</p>
            <h1>{{ settings.hero.title }}</h1>
            <p>{{ settings.hero.tagline_bottom }}</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section id="news">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
            <span>NEWS</span>
            <h2>お知らせ</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="news-list reveal">
            {% set news = oshirase.items | recent %}
            {% if news.length == 0 %}
            <p class="empty-note">現在お知らせはありません。</p>
            {% endif %}
            {% for item in news %}
            <div class="news-item {% if item.important %}is-important{% endif %}">
                <span class="news-date">{{ item.date | date_ja }}</span>
                {% if item.important %}<span class="news-badge">重要</span>{% endif %}
                <div class="news-title">{{ item.title }}</div>
                <p>{{ item.body }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </section>

<section id="history">
  <div class="section-header reveal">
    <span>HISTORY</span>
    <h2>御由緒と歩み</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="history-container">
    <div class="history-text reveal">
      <p>創建は遥か古に遡ります。伝承によれば、この國坂の地に少彦名命が降臨し、人々に農耕の術と病を治す知恵を授けたことが始まりとされています。</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">中世では武将や地元有力者から督い崇敬を受け、幾多の戦乱の中でも絶えることなく社火が守り継がれました。江戸時代には「医薬の神」としての名声が中国地方一帯に広まり、疫病が流行した際には多くの人々がその神威を頼り、病気平癒を祈願したと伝えられています。明治・昭和の激動期を経ても、その伝統と格式は今もなお地域の人々によって守り継がれています。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="history-timeline reveal">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-year">837年（承和4年）</span>
        <p>『続日本後紀』に記録。従五位下を授かる。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-year">867年（貞観9年）</span>
        <p>『日本三代実録』に記録。正五位上に昇叙。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-year">927年（延長5年）</span>
        <p>『延喜式』神名帳に記載、式内社に列せられる。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-year">1524年（大永4年）頃</span>
        <p>戦火を免れ、社殿が維持された記録が残る。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
    <section id="deity" style="background: #fff;">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
            <span>DEITY</span>
            <h2>御祭神</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
            <h3 style="color: var(--shuiro); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 30px;">少彦名神 <small>(すくなひこなのかみ)</small></h3>
            <p>日本神話において大国主神と共に「国造り」を成し遂げた神。ガガイモの船に乗り、蛾の皮の着物を着た小さな神様ですが、その智慧と神力は絶大です。医薬・温泉・まじないの法を定め、人々の病を治し、鳥獣や昆虫の災いを除く術を教え広めました。また「酒造りの神」としての側面も持ち、万民の生命を育む神として崇められています。</p>

            <div class="grid" style="margin-top: 60px;">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>病気平癒・身体健康</h3>
                    <p>医療従事者の守護神として名高く、難病平癒や手術の成功を祈る参拝者が絶えません。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>産業開発・商売繁盛</h3>
                    <p>新たな事業の興隆や商いの繁栄を願う人々に、少彦名神の豊かな知恵を授けます。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>厄除け・災難除け</h3>
                    <p>生活の基本である「食」の安全や、予期せぬ厄災から家庭を堅固に守護します。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

